# INVWINLB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: an item's loans
# and the loan keys by level.  At level 2, Loans and holds shows item 1's
# loans, none.  INS shows a new loan, its item preset and no item asked
# for; given a borrower, a date out and a due date in the past, it is
# added and marked late.  ENTER shows it in view mode; CTRL+E edits it,
# the focus on the borrower as the quantity is fixed now, and the contact
# and notes saved show in view mode.  Return or release returns it on a
# date typed, which its row shows, no longer late; Return or release
# again, the date left empty, is refused by the server, its reason in the
# dialog, which ESC leaves.  ESC goes back to the item list.  After File
# > Log out, at level 1, in item 1's loans INS, CTRL+E and CTRL+R show
# INV's refusal in a message box and ENTER still shows the loan; Items >
# Loans lists no open loan; the end by Exit.  Every date is typed, so
# that no snapshot holds the day of the run.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINLB.SNP is its snapshot.
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER ALT-C A
S EMPTY
K INS
S NEW
K TAB
T Carol King
K TAB TAB
T 2020-01-01
K TAB
T 2020-02-01
K ENTER
S LENT
K ENTER
S VIEW
K ENTER CTRL-E
S EDIT
K TAB
T 555-0100
# past the date out, the due date and the return date to the notes
K TAB TAB TAB TAB
T Boxed with its manual
K ENTER ENTER
S SAVED
K ENTER ALT-C R
T 2026-10-03
K ENTER
S RETURNED
K ALT-C R ENTER
S AGAIN
K ESC ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-F L
K STAB
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER ALT-C A INS
S NOINS
K ENTER CTRL-E
S NOEDIT
K ENTER CTRL-R
S NORES
K ENTER ENTER
S VIEW1
K ENTER ALT-I O
S NOOPEN
K ALT-F X
